msgid "not set"
msgstr "sin ajustar"

msgid ""
"No RTC in\n"
"this bitstream.\n"
"\n"
"Enable `RTC in\n"
"rtl/boards.vh\n"
"then: make flash"
msgstr ""
"Sin RTC en\n"
"este bitstream.\n"
"\n"
"Active `RTC en\n"
"rtl/boards.vh,\n"
"luego: make flash"

msgid ""
"A wall clock, analog or digital.\n"
"\n"
"Tab, arrows\tChoose Analog, Digital or Zone\n"
"Enter/Space\tPress it\n"
"z\tThe time zone: settings\n"
"\n"
"Or click the buttons. The time comes from the RTC, which net sets over NTP; until then it shows no time. The time zone is set in settings -- Zone opens it -- and shown under the digital time."
msgstr ""
"Un reloj de pared, analógico o digital.\n"
"\n"
"Tab, flechas\tElegir Analógico, Digital o Zona\n"
"Intro/Espacio\tPulsarlo\n"
"z\tLa zona horaria: settings\n"
"\n"
"O pulse los botones. La hora viene del RTC, que net ajusta por NTP; hasta entonces no muestra hora. La zona horaria se ajusta en settings -- Zona lo abre -- y se muestra bajo la hora digital."

msgid "Clock help"
msgstr "Ayuda de clock"

msgid "Analog"
msgstr "Analógico"

msgid "Digital"
msgstr "Digital"

msgid "Zone"
msgstr "Zona"
